ck, where conversion drops from 71 percent at 5 minutes to 17 percent at 2 hours. The funnel shows how quickly enquiries leak at each stage."], ["Are missed call statistics in Australia verified?", "Some are better supported than others. The 62 percent voicemail hang up rate and the 71, 55, and 17 percent callback conversion figures come from widely cited call handling and sales research. The 20 to 40 percent in hours miss rate is a commonly cited estimated range that varies by study, and the near 100 percent after hours miss rate follows logically from nobody being available to answer. Treat any single precise national figure with caution."]];

